orth America</strong> as playable levels (Canada &amp; USA) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Added relevant bosses <strong>Coyote</strong>\u00a0&amp;\u00a0<strong>Hailstorm</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Added\u00a0relevant  levels and story to boot  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Conclusion</strong> for the base storyline   Final matchup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL SCHEME UPDATE </strong><i>25.10.2024</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Added a 'classic' <strong>NHL-styled controls schema</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fixed <strong>years</strong> worth of bugs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Coach's choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/1aff3a3ff93d31c2050fafe4a8923f39b1b55dea.jpg"},{"name":"Journey begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/7a628c098589dc92705ad23a41e1ab38a92e7524.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodbath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/d83b02a15f36a438d14916b22c9fc7293b89a446.jpg"},{"name":"Double Vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/01193231cb915c07c11df041d3998b7656c6f177.jpg"},{"name":"Banker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/ef212eb34728c9f163dd80e84f32cfc32b6b850f.jpg"},{"name":"Valkyrie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/c5632707410e4de5b3b333c40cf6eb883be939cf.jpg"},{"name":"Captain Crown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1765990/56344919b348182ef44f19d6abb6eb67f844177c.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea